=== layout: two-panels

# How to Use Zoom Like a Pro

@left

- Mute yourself when you are not speaking.
- Plug in your headphones or earbuds.
- Turn off video if your connection is slow.
- Join class: [{{course_url:class_zoom_short}}]({{course_url:zoom}})

@right

![Zoom guidance: avoid noisy audio](repo:biotech/LECT07/djot/assets/lect05a-2026_biotech_announcements/image_003.png)

=== layout: two-panels

# Setting Your Name in Zoom

@left

- Use your proper first name or a consistent nickname.
- Avoid:
  - Last name first (e.g., "Smith Jane").
  - Something obscure (e.g., "iPhone User").
  - A different name each time: consistency is key.

@right

![Name badge](repo:biotech/evergreen/assets/zoom_name_badge.png)

=== layout: two-panels

# Change Your Name During Class

@left

1. Open *Participants*.
2. Find your name\
   and choose *More* or the three-dot menu.
3. Select *Rename*.
4. Enter your display name and select *Change* (or *Done* on mobile).

@right

![Zoom Participants menu with Rename highlighted](repo:biotech/evergreen/assets/zoom_rename_participants.png)

@citation

Zoom display-name instructions: https://support.zoom.com/hc/en/article?id=zm_kb&sysparm_article=KB0061891

=== layout: two-panels

# Change Name Before a Meeting

@left

- Set your display name before class so it is ready when you join.
  1. Sign in to the Zoom web portal.
  2. Open your profile picture or initials, then *Profile*.
  3. Select *Edit* beside your name.
  4. Set your *Display Name* to your proper first name or consistent nickname.
  5. Select *Save*.
- In the desktop app, *Profile* then *My profile* opens the web profile.

@right

![Zoom profile menu with My Profile highlighted](repo:biotech/evergreen/assets/zoom_profile_menu.png)

@citation

Zoom display-name instructions: https://support.zoom.com/hc/en/article?id=zm_kb&sysparm_article=KB0061891
